<title>USA: New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 13.</title>
<headline>New York grain freight fixtures - Sept 13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>FIXTURES -</p>
<p>TBN 19,000 long tons corn plus 5,000 soybean meal 20-25/9 USG/Sana Marta &amp; Barranquilla $11.00 5,000/2,000 on corn/1,000 on meal Garnac.</p>
<p>TBN 55-60,000 long tons hss 25-30/9 Mississippi/Amsterdam $8.00 11 days Cargill.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities Desk +1 212 859 1640</p>
</text>
